  a triage:Resolution ;
  triage:resolvedBy "quality-mgr" ;
  triage:resolvedAt "2026-09-07T06:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:fixCommit "fb697d14d" ;
  triage:fixBranch "feature/ay8-herdr-socket-transport" ;
  triage:verifiedInRound "qa-pr1280-r3" ;
  triage:resolutionNote "socket_construction_pin.rs:142-166 adds socket_transport_items_remain_crate_private, asserting HerdrHostEnv/HerdrEndpoint/SocketIo/herdr_api_endpoint are pub(crate) and never pub. The reworked sprint doc (pinned c1189a3af, sprint-AY.8-herdr-socket-transport.md D9 + contract block) was itself corrected to specify pub(crate) for all four items, resolving the doc/implementation divergence rather than leaving it open. All three occurrences closed on that basis." .